    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Caricature 2: Delivery Tracker\n\nBefore activating: run supabase/migration.sql and fill the campaign_config row.\n\nSet the Ship24 dashboard webhook URL to this workflow's Ship24 Webhook production URL.\n\nCouriers without tracking: open the form at /form/caricature-delivery-confirm.\n\nCredentials: Supabase API, HubSpot App Token, Slack API, Header Auth `Authorization: Bearer <Ship24 webhook secret>` on the webhook.\n\nFull guide: caricature-campaign/docs/setup.md in github.com/sashank-and-sales-gtme/gtm-engineering-portfolio",
        "height": 520,
